\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Takeaway: on a third-party benchmark of natural-language factual questions, the reference helps when the answer is unique and harms when it is not, reproducing the boundary end to end on tasks we did not construct.} Per-item paired referenced-minus-blind inflation deltas, in baseline standard deviations, item-level bootstrap. Non-math is River plus Language, the entity domains that passed a pre-run completeness audit; math is \textsc  {MACE}'s exactly-verified arithmetic domain, a label-noise control. The step is the $k{>}1$ delta minus the $k{=}1$ delta.}}{9}{table.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:mace}{{5}{9}{\textbf {Takeaway: on a third-party benchmark of natural-language factual questions, the reference helps when the answer is unique and harms when it is not, reproducing the boundary end to end on tasks we did not construct.} Per-item paired referenced-minus-blind inflation deltas, in baseline standard deviations, item-level bootstrap. Non-math is River plus Language, the entity domains that passed a pre-run completeness audit; math is \textsc {MACE}'s exactly-verified arithmetic domain, a label-noise control. The step is the $k{>}1$ delta minus the $k{=}1$ delta}{table.caption.20}{}}
